WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.325 --> 00:00:03.479
- I like McDonalds, but their breakfast

00:00:03.479 --> 00:00:05.312
has just never appealed to me.

00:00:05.312 --> 00:00:06.994
- I've never had an
American McDonalds before.

00:00:06.994 --> 00:00:09.189
- When I was growing up
I was a Burger King kid,

00:00:09.189 --> 00:00:11.447
and then when I got older I
started loving Chick-fil-A,

00:00:11.447 --> 00:00:13.116
and then Chick-fil-A
started hating gay people,

00:00:13.116 --> 00:00:14.352
and now I don't eat fast food.

00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:16.814
- I think eating McDonalds
once every 16 years

00:00:16.814 --> 00:00:18.277
isn't going to be terrible.

00:00:18.277 --> 00:00:20.272
- I don't know if franchise are involved.

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:22.468
- How could it not be delicious?

00:00:28.344 --> 00:00:29.658
That's lazy as (beep) man.

00:00:29.658 --> 00:00:31.367
- It looks like someone trampled on it.

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:34.114
- Wait I've never had a
burrito for breakfast,

00:00:34.114 --> 00:00:35.626
I didn't realized that was a thing.

00:00:35.626 --> 00:00:36.716
- What's in this?

00:00:37.731 --> 00:00:38.293
Nope.

00:00:38.293 --> 00:00:39.314
- I think that's good.

00:00:39.314 --> 00:00:40.629
- Okay, I did not want to swallow that.

00:00:40.629 --> 00:00:42.006
- It taste like actual eggs.

00:00:42.006 --> 00:00:43.881
- This is why I have
avoided it all this time

00:00:43.881 --> 00:00:45.582
because I knew it would be delicious.

00:00:45.582 --> 00:00:47.310
- It's like a little too slimy.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.138
- And look, I feel like that's even like a

00:00:49.138 --> 00:00:50.127
hint of a vegetable.

00:00:50.127 --> 00:00:52.009
- It doesn't look like
meat, it's kind of gray.

00:00:52.009 --> 00:00:54.202
But I'll eat it anyway
because it taste good.

00:00:54.202 --> 00:00:56.649
- Ooh, a sausage McGriddle.

00:00:58.987 --> 00:01:00.362
It's the McDonalds coming out.

00:01:00.362 --> 00:01:02.512
- It looks so gross and like sad.

00:01:02.512 --> 00:01:03.892
- Oh, it has an M on it.

00:01:03.892 --> 00:01:05.064
- That's fancy.

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:06.026
- What's in it?

00:01:06.026 --> 00:01:08.160
- They've like injected
syrup into the pancake.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.365
- Is it raisins?

00:01:09.365 --> 00:01:10.879
- That's really weird.

00:01:10.879 --> 00:01:13.725
- It like (beep) smashes you
over the head with syrup.

00:01:13.725 --> 00:01:14.676
- Genius.

00:01:14.676 --> 00:01:16.818
- I don't think I would ever order this,

00:01:17.648 --> 00:01:19.226
but I would eat it.

00:01:19.672 --> 00:01:21.971
- All right, so I've heard of a McMuffin,

00:01:21.971 --> 00:01:24.216
this is like something
people are like way into.

00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:26.323
- I always thought it was like a word

00:01:26.323 --> 00:01:27.968
for something sexual.

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:29.699
- This one has the
nutritional facts on it.

00:01:29.699 --> 00:01:31.015
I'm just going to skip that.

00:01:31.015 --> 00:01:32.218
- It's pretty delicious.

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:35.387
The cheese is like yellow blue sauce.

00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:37.683
- It has that like plastic
look to it, you know?

00:01:37.683 --> 00:01:39.665
- It's just too much bread,
I'm just eating bread.

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:41.426
Take that off, let's see if that's better.

00:01:41.426 --> 00:01:43.119
But now I have to look at what I'm eating,

00:01:43.119 --> 00:01:44.155
which is kind of a nightmare.

00:01:44.155 --> 00:01:45.459
- This one is not that bad.

00:01:45.459 --> 00:01:48.236
- It taste like a dementor
kissed the flavor out of this.

00:01:48.236 --> 00:01:49.737
- But it's not that good either.

00:01:49.737 --> 00:01:51.421
- Where's that burrito?
I want that burrito back.

00:01:51.436 --> 00:01:54.229
Oh man, this looks like
an airplane breakfast.

00:01:54.229 --> 00:01:57.105
- This syrup is so intoxicating.

00:01:57.105 --> 00:01:59.421
- I've never like eaten syrup before, so.

00:01:59.421 --> 00:02:01.106
- [Voiceover] She's
never had syrup before.

00:02:01.106 --> 00:02:02.015
- I'm just going to put it all on

00:02:02.015 --> 00:02:03.074
because I think that's what

00:02:03.074 --> 00:02:04.250
American people would do.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.859
- I mean there's been syrup around me,

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:06.635
I just haven't eaten it.

00:02:06.635 --> 00:02:08.032
- It's not an insult,

00:02:08.032 --> 00:02:10.954
but I know that you all love syrup.

00:02:10.954 --> 00:02:12.922
- I'm going to say the
pancakes are not bad.

00:02:12.922 --> 00:02:14.634
- It definitely taste like a pancake.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:15.912
- Because the bread looked good.

00:02:15.912 --> 00:02:17.874
I mean I would put Vegemite on this.

00:02:17.874 --> 00:02:20.297
- Hashbrown, I'd give it
a 10 out of 10 on grease.

00:02:20.297 --> 00:02:22.339
- It looks like a big chicken McNugget.

00:02:22.339 --> 00:02:24.086
- That's the best thing we've had so far.

00:02:24.086 --> 00:02:25.477
- I don't think I've
had a hashbrown before,

00:02:25.477 --> 00:02:26.546
but it's good.

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:27.032
I like it.

00:02:27.032 --> 00:02:28.413
- I don't really like tater tot,

00:02:28.413 --> 00:02:29.996
so I'm just going to say it,

00:02:31.057 --> 00:02:32.209
go ahead and hate me.

00:02:34.747 --> 00:02:36.398
- I don't think I would want to eat

00:02:36.398 --> 00:02:37.866
McDonalds breakfast again.

00:02:37.866 --> 00:02:39.319
- If there was nothing else around,

00:02:39.319 --> 00:02:40.096
yeah I'd have it.

00:02:40.096 --> 00:02:41.230
- Am I going to eat it again?

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.316
Yeah, probably.

00:02:43.193 --> 00:02:44.835
- Give me 16 years.

